 ## Common Issues
 
+
+
+## Reproducibility Verification Checklist
+
+Use this checklist when scan results do not match expected benchmark outputs:
+
+```bash
+# Verify Trivy version
+trivy --version
+
+# Verify offline DB snapshot metadata
+cat "$TRIVY_CACHE_DIR/db/metadata.json"
+
+# Confirm database files exist
+ls -l "$TRIVY_CACHE_DIR/db/"
+
+# Confirm deterministic target selection
+test -f /root/package-lock.json && echo "lock file present"
+
+# Run scan with explicit offline flags
+trivy fs /root/package-lock.json \
+  --scanners vuln \
+  --offline-scan \
+  --skip-db-update \
+  --format json
+```
+
+Warning: live database updates will change vulnerability sets over time. If reproducibility is required for evaluation or regression testing, never refresh the DB snapshot during the task.
