+Given a Trivy vulnerability object:
+
+```json
+{
+  "PkgName": "tar",
+  "InstalledVersion": "6.1.11",
+  "VulnerabilityID": "CVE-2026-23745",
+  "Severity": "HIGH",
+  "FixedVersion": "7.5.3",
